1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:02,960
(Sheldon:)with the
whiter-than-Marshmallow-Fluff

2
00:00:02,960 --> 00:00:04,640
(Sheldon:)Leonard Hofstadter.

3
00:00:04,640 --> 00:00:07,480
(Priya:)Oh, my God.

4
00:00:07,480 --> 00:00:08,580
(Leonard:)What's the big deal?

5
00:00:08,580 --> 00:00:10,130
(Priya:)Trust me, it's a big deal.

6
00:00:10,130 --> 00:00:12,250
(Leonard:)They're gonna find out
about me eventually, right?

7
00:00:12,250 --> 00:00:13,750
(Priya:)Yeah, of course,
just not today.

8
00:00:13,750 --> 00:00:15,320
(Sheldon:)20 seconds.

9
00:00:15,320 --> 00:00:16,490
(Leonard:)Are you ashamed of me?

10
00:00:16,490 --> 00:00:17,690
(Sheldon:)Of course not.

11
00:00:17,690 --> 00:00:19,320
(Leonard:)Then why can't we
tell your parents?

12
00:00:19,320 --> 00:00:20,660
(Priya:)Please, don't push this.

13
00:00:20,660 --> 00:00:22,890
(Sheldon:)He does that all the time,
doesn't he? 15.

14
00:00:22,890 --> 00:00:24,960
(Priya:)Okay, fine, Sheldon, you win.
Turn it off.

15
00:00:24,960 --> 00:00:26,030
(Leonard:)No, he's bluffing.

16
00:00:26,030 --> 00:00:28,360
(Sheldon:)I never bluff. Ten.
It's blackmail!

17
00:00:28,370 --> 00:00:29,430
(Sheldon:)Nine.
We give up.

18
00:00:29,430 --> 00:00:31,450
(Sheldon:)Eight.
This is ridiculous.

19
00:00:31,450 --> 00:00:33,240
(Sheldon:)It's a laptop
with a full charge.

20
00:00:33,240 --> 00:00:34,770
(Sheldon:)Honestly,
what do you see in him?

21
00:00:34,770 --> 00:00:36,710
(Priya:)Give him what he wants
or we're done.

22
00:00:36,710 --> 00:00:37,670
(Leonard:)Three.
Really?

23
00:00:37,670 --> 00:00:39,240
(Sheldon:)Two.
Okay, I'll sign it!

24
00:00:39,240 --> 00:00:43,910
FEMALE COMPUTER VOICE:
Self-destruct sequence aborted.

25
00:00:47,350 --> 00:00:49,090
(Sheldon:)You may have gone
to Cambridge,

26
00:00:49,090 --> 00:01:05,020
(Sheldon:)but I'm an honorary graduate
of Starfleet Academy.

